<task id="to_edit_or_delete_an_action_flow_6b8d12" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>To edit or delete an Action Flow</title>
   <shortdesc>You can auto-execute the action flow and launch an action from Source CRM as well.</shortdesc>
   <prolog>
      <author type="creator">Rakesh Singh</author>
       <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>Action</keyword>
        <keyword>Flow</keyword>
        <keyword>delete</keyword>
        <keyword>User</keyword>
        <keyword>Menu</keyword>
        <keyword>action</keyword>
        <indexterm>Action</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Flow</indexterm>
        <indexterm>delete</indexterm>
      </keywords>
          <prodinfo>
        <prodname/>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <taskbody>
      <steps>
         <step>
            <cmd>Highlight an Action Flow on the Action Flow list.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click <b>Edit</b> or <b>Delete</b>.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>To delete an Action Flow that has already been associated with a User Menu button, first, remove the association in the User Menu.</cmd>
         </step>
      </steps>
      <result>
         <p>You can auto-execute the action flow and <xref href="../launching_an_x_author_for_exce_98667728/launching_an_xauthor_for_excel_app_from_salesforce.dita">launch an action from Source CRM</xref> as well.</p>
      </result>
   </taskbody>
</task>